To understand how HTML (the skeleton) and CSS (the paint) work together, we are going to modify [src/App.vue](file:///mnt/NoGaem/Documents/%2802%29Mycodeworks/Macondo/ForRead/for-read/src/App.vue). 

Open [src/App.vue](file:///mnt/NoGaem/Documents/%2802%29Mycodeworks/Macondo/ForRead/for-read/src/App.vue) in your editor, delete everything in it, and replace it with the code block below. 

